       DATA DIVISION.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE Sld-Fan::Value TO WS-N
           MOVE WS-N TO WS-N-TXT
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-LINE
           STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-N-TXT) "%" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-LINE
           MOVE WS-LINE TO Lbl-Fan::Caption
]]></Event>
  </Control>
